  "notes": [
    "The server publishes no MCP protocol version; the tool pages carry a Developer Preview warning.",
    "Times are ISO 8601 strings (startTime, endTime) with an optional IANA timeZone; the Event's start and end are DateOrDateTime objects {dateTime, timeZone}.",
    "calendarId defaults to the primary calendar; this world's calendar IDs are CAL-PRIMARY, CAL-TEAM and CAL-RO rather than email addresses.",
    "Writes are approval-gated and version-checked by policy (workbook C06, C07): approval_id and expected_version are local arguments, and delete_event's recurring_action distinguishes one occurrence from the series (workbook M03 invariant 3)."
  ],
